Models (downloaded at runtime)
- Whisper speech recognition models (OpenAI), CTranslate2 conversions
  (Systran/faster-whisper-*, dropbox-dash/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo,
  distil-whisper/*) - MIT
- Kokoro-82M text-to-speech (hexgrad), ONNX export
  onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX - Apache-2.0
- mouseyy/uk_wav2vec2_with_stress_mark (rt-phonetic) - see its model card
- LLM used for translation: chosen and loaded by the operator of the llama
  worker; not distributed with this project

Libraries and programs (installed through Nix)
- faster-whisper, CTranslate2, ONNX Runtime, FastAPI, Starlette, Uvicorn,
  httpx, Pydantic, loguru - MIT
- PyTorch, NumPy, SciPy - BSD-3-Clause
- Hugging Face transformers, huggingface_hub - Apache-2.0
- PySide6 / Qt for Python - LGPL-3.0 (dynamically linked)
- llama.cpp (llama-server) - MIT
- espeak-ng - GPL-3.0; used only as a separate program, not linked
